{"t":"Gloom Pillars","s":"gloom-pillars-c604b","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Darklight_Emitter_fa5c18.gif","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Gloom Pillars</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Darklight Emitter\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darklight_Emitter_fa5c18.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Northern Darama</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">One of the four hunting areas accessed through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Vestibule\">Blood Vestibule</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33810,31824,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33810, 31824, 14)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">13.20.13560<br/>July 10, 2023<br/>Summer Update 2023</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nIt is one of the areas of the Rotten Blood Quest. The creatures here deal 3 different elemental damages: Holy, <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire</a> and Earth (and Energy Damage for characters under the influence of at least three Bakragore's Taints), while being sensitive to <a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">Physical</a>, Death, and Energy.\n</p><p>Characters absorb dark energy here, which is displayed as a separate counter next to the character's name (represented by the <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Quest Condition White X\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Quest_Condition_White_X_811425.png\" width=\"11\"/></span> icon). If the counter of a character reaches 100, a painful chain spell triggers on top of them, with an initial distance of 3 tiles and jump distance of 6 tiles. If there are other characters nearby, the chain spell can hit up to 5 targets with an increase of damage per jump:<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</p>\n<ul><li>when a <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knight</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladin</a> is the initial target, the base Energy Damage is 2,250 and it increases 37% per jump</li>\n<li>when a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a> is the initial target, the base Energy Damage is 900 and it increase 90% per jump.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Emitter\"><img alt=\"Darklight Emitter\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darklight_Emitter_fa5c18.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Emitter\">Darklight Emitter</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">20,600</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">27,500</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Darklight Core (Object) (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Darklight Obsidian Axe (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Topaz\">Small Topaz</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Basalt Crumbs (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Armor\">Zaoan Armor</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Amber Staff (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Gem\">Red Gem</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yellow%20Gem\">Yellow Gem</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1× <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Gem\">Green Gem</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Construct\"><img alt=\"Darklight Construct\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darklight_Construct_cf1b27.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Construct\">Darklight Construct</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">22,050</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">32,200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Dark Obsidian Splinter (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Darklight Core (Object) (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Darklight Obsidian Axe (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Magma Amulet (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Gem\">Red Gem</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Shoes\">Zaoan Shoes</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>2-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\">Small Ruby</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1× <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Gem\">Green Gem</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wandering%20Pillar\"><img alt=\"Wandering Pillar\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wandering_Pillar_6368dd.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Wandering%20Pillar\">Wandering Pillar</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">23,200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">37,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Darklight Obsidian Axe (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Basalt Crumbs (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sulphurous%20Stone\">Sulphurous Stone</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Helmet\">Dark Helmet</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Darklight Core (Object) (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Magma Boots (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Coal\">Coal</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Magma Coat (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Onyx%20Chip\">Onyx Chip</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Sword\">Fire Sword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Magma Clump (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Gem\">Red Gem</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Gem\">Green Gem</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Basalt Core (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Converter\"><img alt=\"Converter\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Converter_3a9a95.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Converter\">Converter</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">21,425</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">29,600</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Wand of Starstorm (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Darklight Obsidian Axe (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Darklight Core (Object) (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Might%20Ring\">Might Ring</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Health%20Potion\">Ultimate Health Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Focus Cape (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Mana%20Potion\">Ultimate Mana Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Darklight Matter (Object) (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Lightning Legs (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Gem\">Blue Gem</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Gem\">White Gem</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-References\">References</span></h3>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"w-cite_note-1\"><b>^</b> <span class=\"reference-text\">Apr 09 2024 - Balancing Project Changes Part IV</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>","quests":[]}